lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Tao participates in a public debate competition for the first time. As a member of the debate team, he stands in front of the podium and prepares his opening statement, his heart beats faster.\n\n[Question]\nZhang Tao should feel nervous at the start of the debate, but why does he look very confident?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Tao thinks that the mentor may be encouraging him, this makes him feel confident during the debate.\nB. Zhang Tao underestimates the level of the opposing debate team.\nC. Zhang Tao's long-term debate skills and full preparation quickly get him into the state.\nD. Zhang Tao thinks that he cannot let his teammates and mentor down, this boosts his confidence.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694805340372674,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52ba9c2ddb05a7fe30eb0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452393877,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:59:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7112ceacd90c4fbba43f5afa28f69ee3"}